{"agent":"requirements","call":2,"response":{"content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_0175QMcbR2jPYyz1SvkLEsRU","name":"submit_handover","input":{"summary":"CHECKOUT-01 requirements analysis (Requirements Agent).\n\nSources: user-story-v3 and acceptance-criteria ac-v2.\n\nExpected values for the example basket (headphones €100 goods, shipping €5):\n- Discount: 10% of goods = €10.00 (applies to goods only)\n- Goods after discount: €90.00\n- Shipping: €5.00 (not discounted)\n- Expected order total after SAVE10: €95.00 (no SAVE10: €105.00)\n\nAcceptance criteria:\n- AC-1: Entering SAVE10 on the cart page shows \"Coupon SAVE10 applied\".\n- AC-2: SAVE10 gives 10% off goods in the basket.\n- AC-3: Shipping is never discounted; total €95.00 for the example basket.\n\nDiscrepancy to note: the user story says the code is entered \"at checkout\", but AC-1 says \"on the cart page\". UI tests should check the cart page message as AC-1 specifies, and should also verify the code can be applied in the checkout flow, since the story names checkout. Flag for the product owner if unclear; do not assume one overrides the other silently.\n\nIdentified risks and test conditions:\n1. Happy path: SAVE10 on €100 goods + €5 shipping → message shown, total €95.00.\n2. Shipping discount leak: total must not be €90.00 or €94.50. Shipping must stay €5.00.\n3. Percentage math: verify 10% on goods with other amounts (e.g. rounding to cents on odd prices such as €33.33 → €3.00 discount, €29.99 → €26.99 goods).\n4. Case sensitivity and whitespace: \"save10\", \" SAVE10 \" — behaviour not specified in the requirement; treat as open question, do not invent expected results.\n5. Invalid or unknown code: should show an error and no discount; not specified in AC, open question.\n6. Applying SAVE10 twice: should not stack to 20%; not specified, open question.\n7. Removing the code or changing basket quantity after applying: discount should recalculate to 10% of new goods total.\n8. Tax handling: not specified; do not assert tax figures unless the team confirms.\n9. Message exact text \"Coupon SAVE10 applied\" must match exactly.\n\nTeam should use the example basket values above as the single source of truth for expected totals."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","usage":{"input_tokens":637,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":615,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"iterations":[{"input_tokens":637,"output_tokens":1003,"cache_read_input_tokens":615,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message","model":null}],"output_tokens":1003,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":177},"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","latency_ms":5205}}
